 Good morning! The Future of Defense Summit nears.

 We've added Gen. Christopher LaNeve, Adm. Daryl Caudle and Rep. Gregory Meeks (D-N.Y.) to the lineup. Request an invite ASAP. 🇬🇷 Situational awareness: Greece inked a deal for up to six KC-390 Millennium aircraft made by Embraer. The Hellenic Air Force expects to receive the first next year.

 Whoa, there: Talking Taiwan in Hawai'i, hypersonic missiles for the F-16 and a fire at the Savannah River Site.

